<title>GREECE: Tasoglou-Delonghi has lower 1996 profit.</title>
<headline>Tasoglou-Delonghi has lower 1996 profit.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece's electrical appliance wholesaler Tasoglou Delonghi said its 1996 pretax profit fell 18.9 percent to 940 million drachmas from 1.16 billion a year earlier on sales growth of 2.7 percent to 7.4 billion.</p>
</text>
